; GENERATED by tools/gen_audio.sh -- re-run it rather than editing here.
;
; The zone volumes and the ambience bed. Instanced into demo_level.tscn.
;
; A zone is an Area3D on the player body layer, and AudioZone.gd checks the
; "player" group as well -- the layer alone is the default one, so a crate
; or a door leaf would otherwise count as the player walking in. The boxes
; do not overlap: House starts above the ground slab, Cellar and StormPit
; sit below it, and everywhere else is outdoors by default.

